 tools like SonarQube ensures that I contribute clean, tested, and deployable code to the team from day one.\n\nMy technical foundation is further strengthened by my Master's coursework in Introduction to Cloud Computing and Software Testing & Quality Assurance. During my program, I studied Cloud Computing, which allows me to effectively design and deploy cloud-native systems that utilize modern infrastructure efficiently. I also have deep knowledge of HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and Webpack, ensuring I can contribute to the full software solution while maintaining awareness of the technology roadmap and emerging engineering practices.\n\nI have long admired T-Mobile’s culture of innovation and its focus on being a jungle gym of possibilities for its employees. I am confident that my technical curiosity and background in full-stack development make me a perfect fit for this associate role. I look forward to the opportunity to discuss how my experience in Java and React can contribute to the continued success of the Product Development team.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to the possibility of discussing how I can contribute to the T-Mobile engineering team.\n\nSincerely,\nSai Teja Mukkera\nhttps://saiteja-dev-portfolio.vercel.app\nhttps://www.github.com/saitejamukkera	%-------------------------\n% Resume in Latex (ATS Optimized) - 1 Page Jobright Style + Icons\n%------------------------\n\n\\documentclass[letterpaper,10pt]{article}\n\n\\usepackage{latexsym}\n\\usepackage[empty]{fullpage}\n\\usepackage{titlesec}\n\\usepackage{marvosym}\n\\usepackage[usenames,dvipsnames]{color}\n\\usepackage{enumitem}\n\\usepackage[hidelinks]{hyperref}\n\\usepackage{fancyhdr}\n\\usepackage{fontawesome5}\n\\usepackage[english]{babel}\n\\usepackage{tabularx}\n\\input{glyphtounicode}\n\n\\pagestyle{fancy}\n\\fancyhf{}\n\\fancyfoot{}\n\\renewcommand{\\headrulewidth}{0pt}\n\\renewcommand{\\footrulewidth}{0pt}\n\n% MARGINS (slightly tighter but ATS-safe)\n\\addtolen