ce efficiency.}\n    \\resumeItem{Streamlined deployment workflows through \\textbf{GitHub Actions} and \\textbf{Agile} practices, maintaining high code quality standards via \\textbf{SonarQube} gates and peer reviews.}\n  \\resumeItemListEnd\n\n\\resumeSubheading\n  {Associate Software Engineer}{Feb 2022 -- Oct 2022}\n  {Cognizant Technology Solutions}{Hyderabad, India}\n  \\resumeItemListStart\n    \\resumeItem{Maintained backend services using \\textbf{Java}, implementing logic updates and minor feature enhancements to ensure consistency with technical requirements.}\n    \\resumeItem{Triaged and debugged \\textbf{RESTful API} issues by analyzing \\textbf{JavaScript} web traffic logs, identifying root causes for data flow bottlenecks and applying permanent fixes.}\n    \\resumeItem{Verified software functionality by developing unit tests in \\textbf{JUnit}, contributing to a stable codebase and reducing manual QA effort for routine module updates.}\n  \\resumeItemListEnd\n\n\\resumeSubHeadingListEnd\n\n%-----------PROJECTS-----------\n\\section{Projects}\n\\resumeSubHeadingListStart\n\n\\resumeSubheading\n  {Developer Portfolio Website $|$ \\hspace{1pt} \\href{https://saiteja-dev-portfolio.vercel.app} {\\faLink} \\hspace{2pt} \\href{https://github.com/saitejamukkera/Portfolio}{\\faGithub}}{Jan 2025 -- Present}\n  {\\small React, TypeScript, TailwindCSS, Shadcn UI, Framer Motion}{}\n  \\resumeItemListStart\n    \\resumeItem{Architected a responsive SPA using \\textbf{React} and \\textbf{TypeScript}, enforcing strict static typing to minimize runtime errors and enhance codebase scalability.}\n    \\resumeItem{Designed a modular UI system with \\textbf{TailwindCSS} and \\textbf{Shadcn UI}, focusing on \\textbf{component reusability} and dark mode.}\n    \\resumeItem{Optimized frontend performance and SEO strategies, achieving a \\textbf{95+ Google Lighthouse score} across metrics.}\n  \\resumeItemListEnd\n\n\\resumeSubheading\n  {JobRadar (Full-Stack Application) $|