ce-oriented architectures within the travel servicing domain.}\n    \\resumeItem{Maintained production-level \\textbf{RESTful APIs} by troubleshooting code-level bugs and optimizing database queries, directly improving service performance for global end-users.}\n    \\resumeItem{Implemented unit and integration tests using \\textbf{JUnit} and \\textbf{Mockito} to validate functional requirements and ensure high-quality software delivery for travel-related services.}\n  \\resumeItemListEnd\n\n\\resumeSubHeadingListEnd\n\n%-----------PROJECTS-----------\n\\section{Projects}\n\\resumeSubHeadingListStart\n\n\\resumeSubheading\n  {Developer Portfolio Website $|$ \\hspace{1pt} \\href{https://saiteja-dev-portfolio.vercel.app} {\\faLink} \\hspace{2pt} \\href{https://github.com/saitejamukkera/Portfolio}{\\faGithub}}{Jan 2025 -- Present}\n  {\\small React, TypeScript, TailwindCSS, Shadcn UI, Framer Motion}{}\n  \\resumeItemListStart\n    \\resumeItem{Architected a responsive SPA using \\textbf{React} and \\textbf{TypeScript}, enforcing strict static typing to minimize runtime errors and enhance codebase scalability.}\n    \\resumeItem{Designed a modular UI system with \\textbf{TailwindCSS} and \\textbf{Shadcn UI}, focusing on \\textbf{component reusability} and dark mode.}\n    \\resumeItem{Optimized frontend performance and SEO strategies, achieving a \\textbf{95+ Google Lighthouse score} across metrics.}\n  \\resumeItemListEnd\n\n\\resumeSubheading\n  {JobRadar (Full-Stack Application) $|$ \\hspace{1pt} \\href{https://job-radar.vercel.app}{\\faLink} \\hspace{2pt} \\href{https://github.com/saitejamukkera/job-portal-fullstack-mern}{\\faGithub}}{Oct 2024 -- Jan 2025}\n  {\\small JavaScript, Node.js, React, MongoDB, Express.js, Redux Toolkit}{}\n  \\resumeItemListStart\n    \\resumeItem{Engineered a scalable Job Board platform using the \\textbf{MERN stack}, implementing \\textbf{RBAC} for Recruiters/Applicants.}\n    \\resumeItem{Developed \\textbf{RESTful APIs} with \\textbf{