 full software development lifecycle—from initial architectural design to automated CI/CD deployment—aligns perfectly with Agility Partners’ commitment to engineering excellence and continuous improvement.\n\nMy technical foundation is further supported by my academic performance. During my Master's program, I studied Advanced Applications Programming in Java and Software Testing & Quality Assurance, which allows me to apply sophisticated architectural concepts and rigorous validation techniques to enterprise-grade codebases. This combination of hands-on experience with the Spring ecosystem (Core, MVC, and Boot), relational database management, and modern web frameworks positions me to contribute immediately to your development goals.\n\nI am enthusiastic about the opportunity to join Agility Partners and support the core business applications of your enterprise clients. I am confident that my technical proficiency in Java and my dedication to collaborative problem-solving will make me a valuable asset to your team. Thank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to the possibility of discussing how I can contribute to Agility Partners' ongoing success.\n\nSincerely,\nSai Teja Mukkera\nhttps://www.saitejamukkera.dev\nhttps://www.github.com/saitejamukkera	%-------------------------\n% Resume in Latex (ATS Optimized) - 1 Page Jobright Style (Text Only)\n%------------------------\n\n\\documentclass[a4paper,10pt]{article}\n\n\\usepackage{latexsym}\n\\usepackage[empty]{fullpage}\n\\usepackage{titlesec}\n\\usepackage[usenames,dvipsnames]{color}\n\\usepackage{enumitem}\n\\usepackage[hidelinks]{hyperref}\n\\usepackage{fancyhdr}\n\\usepackage[english]{babel}\n\\usepackage{tabularx}\n\\input{glyphtounicode}\n\n\\pagestyle{fancy}\n\\fancyhf{}\n\\fancyfoot{}\n\\renewcommand{\\headrulewidth}{0pt}\n\\renewcommand{\\footrulewidth}{0pt}\n\n% MARGINS (ATS-safe, 1-page)\n\\addtolength{\\oddsidemargin}{-0.5in}\n\\addtolength{\\evensidemargin}{-0.5in}\n\\addtolength{\\textwid