ure and reliable. I have also integrated PostgreSQL and Docker into my development workflow to create containerized environments that streamline deployment pipelines. My technical curiosity drives me to stay current with event-driven architectures and messaging systems like Kafka, which I understand are central to the Pricing team's goal of building robust producer-consumer data pipelines.\n\nDuring my Master's program, I studied Advanced Application Programming in Java and Introduction to Cloud Computing, which allows me to architect cloud-ready microservices and apply sophisticated design patterns to solve real-world pricing challenges. My full-stack capabilities, evidenced by my proficiency in React and the MERN stack for building intuitive recruiter platforms, ensure that I can collaborate effectively across functional boundaries to translate product requirements into high-impact technical solutions.\n\nI am deeply impressed by the people-centric culture at DICK’S Sporting Goods and the emphasis on empowering teammates to be innovators. As someone who thrives in a remote-first, collaborative environment, I am confident that my technical skills and eagerness to learn from my peers will make me a valuable addition to your Pittsburgh-based campus community. Thank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to the possibility of discussing how I can contribute to the continued success of the Pricing team.\n\nSincerely,\nSai Teja Mukkera\nhttps://www.saitejamukkera.dev\nhttps://www.github.com/saitejamukkera	%-------------------------\n% Resume in Latex (ATS Optimized) - 1 Page Jobright Style + Icons\n%------------------------\n\n\\documentclass[letterpaper,10pt]{article}\n\n\\usepackage{latexsym}\n\\usepackage[empty]{fullpage}\n\\usepackage{titlesec}\n\\usepackage{marvosym}\n\\usepackage[usenames,dvipsnames]{color}\n\\usepackage{enumitem}\n\\usepackage[hidelinks]{hyperref}\n\\usepackage{fancyhdr}\n\\usepackage{fontawesome5}\n\\usepackage[english]{babel}\n\\us