rs of experience in the job offered or in a related software development occupation. Must have 2 years of experience with the following: designing and developing backend services using object-oriented languages such as Java or Python; developing front-end applications or components using JavaScript, TypeScript, and React; building and maintaining RESTful APIs within a microservices architecture; utilizing cloud services(such as AWS, Azure, GCP) for application deployment and management; working with both SQL and NoSQL databases, utilizing the ELK Stack for NoSQL data storage, indexing, and complex queries; designing and implementing applications using serverless architectures (e.g., AWS Lambda, Azure Functions) and event-driven patterns; using containerization technologies such as Docker and orchestration tools like Kubernetes; applying Agile development methodologies and using version control systems like Git. Telecommuting permitted up to 2 days per week.\n\nADDITIONAL INFORMATION:\n\nLocation: Hamilton, NJ\nSalary: $148,129/year\n40 hours/week\n		Hamilton, NJ	ACTIVE	Software Engineer II	7
