 gates. I am comfortable working within an agile framework, providing technical guidance to junior team members, and interacting with stakeholders to refine technical requirements for financial applications.\n\nMy technical repertoire includes Core Java, Spring Boot, REST APIs, and Oracle DB, alongside exposure to frontend frameworks like Angular and React. During my Master's program, I studied Advanced Application Programming in Java and Advanced Computer Networking & Security, which allows me to contribute to Fiserv by building not only functional but also highly secure and optimized payment processing platforms. These courses provided me with a deep understanding of multi-threaded programming and secure communication protocols, which are essential for the financial services settlement and reporting industry.\n\nI am eager to bring my technical curiosity and problem-solving skills to the Fiserv team in Milwaukee. I am confident that my experience in building resilient backend systems and my dedication to software process improvement will make me a valuable asset to your innovative team. Thank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to the possibility of discussing how I can contribute to Fiserv’s mission of moving the world through financial technology.\n\nSincerely,\nSai Teja Mukkera\nhttps://www.saitejamukkera.dev\nhttps://www.github.com/saitejamukkera	%-------------------------\n% Resume in Latex (ATS Optimized) - 1 Page Jobright Style (Text Only)\n%------------------------\n\n\\documentclass[letterpaper,10pt]{article}\n\n\\usepackage{latexsym}\n\\usepackage[empty]{fullpage}\n\\usepackage{titlesec}\n\\usepackage[usenames,dvipsnames]{color}\n\\usepackage{enumitem}\n\\usepackage[hidelinks]{hyperref}\n\\usepackage{fancyhdr}\n\\usepackage[english]{babel}\n\\usepackage{tabularx}\n\\input{glyphtounicode}\n\n\\pagestyle{fancy}\n\\fancyhf{}\n\\fancyfoot{}\n\\renewcommand{\\headrulewidth}{0pt}\n\\renewcommand{\\footrulewidth}{0pt}\n\n% MARGINS (ATS-safe, 1-p