t operational excellence standards. Master’s degree in Computer Science (GPA 4.0) with a focus on cloud computing and distributed systems, eager to contribute to Galileo’s banking core transformation.\n\n%-----------EDUCATION-----------\n\\section{Education}\n\\resumeSubHeadingListStart\n  \\resumeSubheading\n    {University of Central Missouri}{Warrensburg, MO, USA}\n    {Master of Science in Computer Science \\textbf{(GPA: 4.0)}}{Jan 2024 -- Dec 2025}\n  \\resumeSubheading\n    {Guru Nanak Institute of Technology}{Hyderabad, India}\n    {Bachelor of Technology in Electronics and Communication Engineering}{Jul 2015 -- Jul 2019}\n\\resumeSubHeadingListEnd\n\n%-----------EXPERIENCE-----------\n\\section{Experience}\n\\resumeSubHeadingListStart\n\n\\resumeSubheading\n  {Software Engineer}{Oct 2021 -- Dec 2023}\n  {Cognizant Technology Solutions}{Hyderabad, India}\n  \\resumeItemListStart\n    \\resumeItem{Architected and maintained 6+ Spring Boot microservices for financial transaction processing on \\textbf{AWS (EC2, RDS, S3)}, supporting 10K+ active users with 99.8\\% system uptime.}\n    \\resumeItem{Deployed containerized applications using \\textbf{Docker}, standardizing the production environment and reducing cross-environment configuration issues by 30\\%.}\n    \\resumeItem{Enhanced scalability of high-traffic REST APIs by optimizing \\textbf{DTO patterns} and implementing query indexing, reducing JSON payload size by 40\\% and latency by 25\\%.}\n    \\resumeItem{Engineered robust input validation using \\textbf{JSR-303} and centralized exception handling, ensuring data integrity for financial records and reducing runtime errors by 30\\%.}\n    \\resumeItem{Integrated automated testing into the development lifecycle using \\textbf{JUnit 5} and \\textbf{Mockito}, increasing coverage to 90\\% and reducing regression defects by 25\\%.}\n    \\resumeItem{Managed operational excellence by resolving 40+ critical production incidents via \\textbf{Splunk} and \\textb