n\n%-----------EDUCATION-----------\n\\section{Education}\n\\resumeSubHeadingListStart\n  \\resumeSubheading\n    {University of Central Missouri}{Warrensburg, MO, USA}\n    {Master of Science in Computer Science \\textbf{(GPA: 4.0)}}{Jan 2024 -- Dec 2025}\n  \\resumeSubheading\n    {Guru Nanak Institute of Technology}{Hyderabad, India}\n    {Bachelor of Technology in Electronics and Communication Engineering}{Jul 2015 -- Jul 2019}\n\\resumeSubHeadingListEnd\n\n%-----------EXPERIENCE-----------\n\\section{Experience}\n\\resumeSubHeadingListStart\n\n\\resumeSubheading\n  {Software Engineer}{Nov 2022 -- Dec 2023}\n  {Cognizant Technology Solutions}{Hyderabad, India}\n  \\resumeItemListStart\n    \\resumeItem{Engineered high-performance microservices using \\textbf{Java} and \\textbf{Spring Boot}, delivering creative technology solutions that met complex business requirements for enterprise-scale stakeholders.}\n    \\resumeItem{Optimized system architecture by refactoring API response structures with \\textbf{DTOs}, achieving a \\textbf{40\\%} reduction in payload size and significantly improving throughput for web services.}\n    \\resumeItem{Hardened application security and compliance by implementing \\textbf{JSR-303 validation} and remediating vulnerabilities, adhering to strict data integrity standards for sensitive user information.}\n    \\resumeItem{Architected an automated testing framework using \\textbf{JUnit 5} and \\textbf{Mockito}, reaching \\textbf{90\\% code coverage} and ensuring the delivery of high-quality, predictable software releases.}\n    \\resumeItem{Resolved 40+ critical production incidents by analyzing \\textbf{Splunk} and \\textbf{Log4j} logs, maintaining application stability through proactive troubleshooting and root-cause mitigation.}\n    \\resumeItem{Streamlined the \\textbf{CI/CD} build and deploy process via \\textbf{GitHub Actions} and \\textbf{SonarQube}, collaborating in \\textbf{Agile} sprints to meet aggressive development schedules and design specifications.}\n  \\resumeItemListEnd\n\n\\resumeSubheading\n  {Associate Software Engineer}{Aug 2021 -- Oct 2022}\n  {Cognizant Technology Solutions}{Hyderabad, India}\n  \\resumeItemListStart\n    \\resumeItem{Collaborated on backend components using \\textbf{Java} and \\textbf{Spring Boot}, writing clean, maintainable code according to team coding standards and technical design reviews.}\n    \\resumeItem{Maintained and enhanced \\textbf{RESTful APIs} by debugging technical hurdles and implementing fixes on \\textbf{Tomcat} application servers to ensure consistent service availability.}\n    \\resumeItem{Developed comprehensive unit tests with \\textbf{JUnit}, identifying and mitigating technical risks early in the project lifecycle to support reliable software delivery.}\n  \\resumeItemListEnd\n\n\\resumeSubHeadingListEnd\n\n%-----------PROJECTS-----------\n\\section{Projects}\n\\resumeSubHeadingListStart\n\n\\resumeSubheading\n  {TrackHire AI $|$ \n\\href{https://trackhireai.vercel.app}{\\underline{Live}} $|$ \n\\href{https://github.com/saitejamukkera/Job-Resume-Tracker}{\\underline{GitHub}}}{Jan 2026 -- Present}\n  {\\small Spring Boot, Java, PostgreSQL, Docker, Caddy, OAuth2, LLM Integration}{}\n  \\resumeItemListStart\n    \\resumeItem{Architected a scalable backend with \\textbf{Spring Boot} and \\textbf{Java}, delivering RESTful APIs for job and resume management, user authentication, and notification workflows.}\n    \\resumeItem{Integrated \\textbf{PostgreSQL} for persistent storage, optimizing schema design and leveraging advanced SQL for transactional reliability and performance.}\n    \\resumeItem{Deployed containerized services using \\textbf{Docker Compose} and secured public endpoints with a \\textbf{Caddy} reverse proxy, automating HTTPS and service orchestration.}\n    \\resumeItem{Enabled AI-powered features by integrating a \\textbf{Large Language Model (LLM)} via the Gemini API, supporting intelligent resume analysis and job