 quickly and independently. This passion for leveraging emerging technologies to solve complex problems is a core part of my professional identity, and I am eager to apply this mindset to the next generation of dealer-facing experiences at CarGurus.\n\nMy technical foundation is further strengthened by my academic pursuits. During my Master's program, I studied Advanced Application Programming in Java and Introduction to Cloud Computing, which allows me to design distributed systems that are both resilient and highly optimized for AWS environments. These courses provided me with a deep understanding of cloud-native architecture and high-level Java performance tuning, which I believe will be instrumental in supporting the core systems of the Competitive Intelligence team.\n\nI have long admired CarGurus for its people-first culture and its status as a pioneer in the automotive digital journey. I am confident that my experience in full-stack development and my passion for data-driven engineering will allow me to make an immediate impact on your team. Thank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to the possibility of discussing how I can contribute to the continued innovation and growth of CarGurus.\n\nSincerely,\nSai Teja Mukkera\nhttps://www.saitejamukkera.dev\nhttps://www.github.com/saitejamukkera	\\documentclass[a4paper,10pt]{article}\n\n\\usepackage{latexsym}\n\\usepackage[empty]{fullpage}\n\\usepackage{titlesec}\n\\usepackage[usenames,dvipsnames]{color}\n\\usepackage{enumitem}\n\\usepackage[hidelinks]{hyperref}\n\\usepackage{fancyhdr}\n\\usepackage[english]{babel}\n\\usepackage{tabularx}\n\\input{glyphtounicode}\n\n\\pagestyle{fancy}\n\\fancyhf{}\n\\fancyfoot{}\n\\renewcommand{\\headrulewidth}{0pt}\n\\renewcommand{\\footrulewidth}{0pt}\n\n% MARGINS (ATS-safe, 1-page)\n\\addtolength{\\oddsidemargin}{-0.5in}\n\\addtolength{\\evensidemargin}{-0.5in}\n\\addtolength{\\textwidth}{1in}\n\\addtolength{\\topmargin}{-0.6in}\n\\addtolength{\\textheight}{1.1in}\