eamless service delivery. My technical curiosity extends into the realm of artificial intelligence, as seen in my recent project where I integrated Large Language Models to provide intelligent analysis features. This blend of backend expertise and a forward-looking approach to AI allows me to contribute meaningfully to CVS Health’s cutting-edge data initiatives.\n\nMy technical foundation is built on expert-level Java and Spring Boot proficiency, with additional experience in Python and SQL/NoSQL databases. During my Master's program, I studied Advanced Applications Programming in Java and Software Testing and Quality Assurance, which allows me to deliver robust, production-ready code that adheres to the highest engineering standards. I also completed coursework in Machine Learning and Introduction to Cloud Computing, providing me with a unique perspective on how to build intelligent, scalable systems that can simplify health care for millions of people.\n\nI am deeply motivated by CVS Health’s commitment to innovation and community-focused care. I am confident that my technical skills, coupled with my proactive problem-solving mindset, will make me a valuable asset to your engineering team. Thank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to the possibility of discussing how I can contribute to the success of CVS Health’s distributed systems.\n\nSincerely,\nSai Teja Mukkera\nhttps://www.saitejamukkera.dev\nhttps://www.github.com/saitejamukkera	%-------------------------\n% Resume in Latex (ATS Optimized) - 1 Page Jobright Style (Text Only)\n%------------------------\n\n\\documentclass[a4paper,10pt]{article}\n\n\\usepackage{latexsym}\n\\usepackage[empty]{fullpage}\n\\usepackage{titlesec}\n\\usepackage[usenames,dvipsnames]{color}\n\\usepackage{enumitem}\n\\usepackage[hidelinks]{hyperref}\n\\usepackage{fancyhdr}\n\\usepackage[english]{babel}\n\\usepackage{tabularx}\n\\input{glyphtounicode}\n\n\\pagestyle{fancy}\n\\fancyhf{}\n\\fancyfoot{}\n\\renewcommand{\\he