ing and collaboration with global, cross-functional teams.\n\nDuring my Master's program, I studied Advanced Application Programming in Java and Advanced Computer Networking & Security, which allows me to architect secure, high-performance backend modules that can withstand the demands of a global payments network. My academic background in Advanced Algorithms also provides me with the problem-solving framework necessary to design efficient transaction mediation and pricing logic from scratch. I am passionate about leveraging technologies like Kafka for messaging and PostgreSQL for robust data management to drive excellence in Visa’s financial technology ecosystem.\n\nI am enthusiastic about the opportunity to join Visa, a world leader in payments technology, and I am confident that my blend of full-stack development skills and DevOps experience will allow me to contribute immediately to the success of your revenue systems. I admire Visa's commitment to uplifting everyone, everywhere, and I look forward to the possibility of discussing how my technical background can support your team’s goals for innovation and reliability.\n\nThank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to the possibility of discussing how I can contribute to the Visa Corporate IT team.\n\nSincerely,\nSai Teja Mukkera\nhttps://saiteja-dev-portfolio.vercel.app\nhttps://www.github.com/saitejamukkera	%-------------------------\n% Resume in Latex (ATS Optimized) - 1 Page Jobright Style + Icons\n%------------------------\n\n\\documentclass[letterpaper,10pt]{article}\n\n\\usepackage{latexsym}\n\\usepackage[empty]{fullpage}\n\\usepackage{titlesec}\n\\usepackage{marvosym}\n\\usepackage[usenames,dvipsnames]{color}\n\\usepackage{enumitem}\n\\usepackage[hidelinks]{hyperref}\n\\usepackage{fancyhdr}\n\\usepackage{fontawesome5}\n\\usepackage[english]{babel}\n\\usepackage{tabularx}\n\\input{glyphtounicode}\n\n\\pagestyle{fancy}\n\\fancyhf{}\n\\fancyfoot{}\n\\renewcommand{\\headrulewidth}{0pt}\n\\rene