 the complex logic required for risk calculations like VaR and sensitivities. These courses have equipped me with the mathematical and algorithmic rigor necessary to handle large-scale data processing in a mission-critical financial environment.\n\nI am highly proficient in Java and Spring Boot, and I am comfortable working in Agile environments using Git and CI/CD tools like GitHub Actions. My technical toolkit also includes experience with PostgreSQL and microservices architecture, which I believe will allow me to integrate seamlessly into your engineering workflows. I am eager to apply my analytical skills and backend expertise to enhance the performance and maintainability of Clearwater’s risk management solutions.\n\nI have long admired Clearwater Analytics’ reputation for delivering world-class investment accounting and reporting solutions. I am confident that my technical background and proactive learning mindset will enable me to contribute meaningfully to the TRMS team from day one. Thank you for your time and consideration. I look forward to the possibility of discussing how I can contribute to the stability and scalability of your financial data services.\n\nSincerely,\nSai Teja Mukkera\nhttps://www.saitejamukkera.dev\nhttps://www.github.com/saitejamukkera	%-------------------------\n% Resume in Latex (ATS Optimized) - 1 Page Jobright Style (Text Only)\n%------------------------\n\n\\documentclass[letterpaper,10pt]{article}\n\n\\usepackage{latexsym}\n\\usepackage[empty]{fullpage}\n\\usepackage{titlesec}\n\\usepackage[usenames,dvipsnames]{color}\n\\usepackage{enumitem}\n\\usepackage[hidelinks]{hyperref}\n\\usepackage{fancyhdr}\n\\usepackage[english]{babel}\n\\usepackage{tabularx}\n\\input{glyphtounicode}\n\n\\pagestyle{fancy}\n\\fancyhf{}\n\\fancyfoot{}\n\\renewcommand{\\headrulewidth}{0pt}\n\\renewcommand{\\footrulewidth}{0pt}\n\n% MARGINS (ATS-safe, 1-page)\n\\addtolength{\\oddsidemargin}{-0.5in}\n\\addtolength{\\evensidemargin}{-0.5in}\n\\addtolength{\\